Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.16,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}隠してもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:21.16,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}藏着也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.54,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFDDA4&}アピってもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.54,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&\}表现出来也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.18,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}フィクションのラブコメは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.18,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}书本里的恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.26,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}嘘ばかり…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.26,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}那都是假的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.62,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}焦ったらバレ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.62,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}一着急就会露馅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.08,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}デレちゃったら負け？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.08,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}害羞了就输了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.90,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}下心隠すのも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.90,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}七七八八小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:30.84,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}必死です!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:30.84,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}非得藏住不可！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:32.21,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}触ってもいい？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:32.21,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}可以摸你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.59,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}ドキッてしてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.59,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}有没有心动？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.22,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}子ども扱いしても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.22,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}把我成当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.30,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}変わんない{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.30,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}我也不会收敛哦{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:37.80,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}分かってないな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:37.80,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}你还是不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.18,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}ズバッといきな！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.18,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}那我就直说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.85,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}親友の特権も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.85,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}我或许也有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:41.97,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}あるかも...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:41.97,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}身为亲友的特权……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:44.64,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作戦も駆け引きも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:44.64,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作战也好、计谋也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.85,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}君には届かない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.85,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}对你统统没用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:50.14,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}どうして好きにさせたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:50.14,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我为什么会喜欢你？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:55.46,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}ラブコメは両思いじゃなきゃダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:55.46,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}恋爱喜剧就一定得是两情相悦！
